==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 23.33~46.67 seconds<sup>700f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 46 seconds<sup>1,380f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Junior God of Light - Valkyrie (Enemy)|Valkyrie]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

